      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SISU SPIRIT (2) was given a good steer at Bunbury last time out when flying from the back to score by 0.5L. Drawn out again, but that seems to be suiting his racing pattern and the figure he turned in last time stacks right up. Rises in weight but can repeat the dose. HERE FOR CHEQUES (4) just missed two back before a 5.3L defeat at Belmont in Saturday grade. Back to this level now suits him much better and his prior performances suggested he was nearing a drought breaking win. IMPRESSIVE JEWEL (6) improved last start coming back to this track and trip, sticking on to finish 2.5L off the winner. Pike hops on now and if she can run up to her latest effort, she'll be in this for a very long way. CELEBRITY PRINCE (5) can improve getting out to the mile for the first time. ELEGANT RULER (7) can bounce back in a more suitable race today.",
